# The build context is the repo root, but every Dockerfile here (Dockerfile,
# Dockerfile.musl, Dockerfile.windows) only COPYs Cargo.toml, Cargo.lock and
# crates/. Allow-list exactly those so the giant siblings — target/ (~59G),
# xet-data/ (~1G), dist/, gitea/, xet-core/, .git/ — never get tarred into the
# context. Add a line here if a Dockerfile starts needing another path.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates

# Defensive: never ship a stray build dir that happens to live inside a crate.
crates/**/target/
